{"path":"/ja/tip/17-05","title":"高齢者に先払いを求める「投資型老後プラン」には一切手を出さないこと：カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活、高齢者向け製品の購入は、すべて同一の違法集金の手口です | HowToLiveBetter","description":"高齢者に先払いを求め、かつリターンを約束する老後プランは、すべて同じ詐欺の手口です。カード作成、ベッド確保、介護マンション、移住型老後生活、セミナーでの高齢者向け製品販売など。規定により、このような資金の損失は自己責任となります。介護マンションのベッド予約を名目に 1.36 億元を回収し、 210…","lang":"ja","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter ホーム","href":"/ja"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"メインナビゲーション"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["本を読む"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["厳選50"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["今日のタスク"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/ja/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["マイリスト"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["その他"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strok